{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This alpha version offers a focused first glimpse into the horror experience Don\u2019t Hang Up<br>Estimated playtime: 10\u201315 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Ben, who enters an abandoned apartment<br>Your smartphone is your central tool \u2014 you can answer or decline calls, write notes, take photos, use the flashlight, and influence the atmosphere through subtle interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in this alpha<br>Fully functional smartphone interface<br>(flashlight, selfies, notes, calls, menu navigation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First scripted calls with simple decisions<br>(answer or hang up \u2013 no branching yet, but sets the tone)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger-based sound and one jumpscare<br>(only triggers once, bound to player interaction and location)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checklist integrated into the phone<br>(players can manually enter their own objectives)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorial \u2013 no objective markers \u2013 no HUD<br>(purposely minimal to observe natural player behavior)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 explorable rooms<br>(kitchen, living room, bathroom, children\u2019s room, bedroom)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated performance settings<br>(scalable graphics including texture quality and shadows)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test focus<br>Stability of core phone functions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic of triggers &amp; sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player orientation without UI aids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative pacing &amp; tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Texture behavior across different systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChatGPT fragen</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899940?t=1756124489","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899940?t=1